  "D4|偽陽性率が高いカテゴリへの対処は。":{q:"How to handle a category with high false-positive rate?",o:["Temporarily disable and improve while restoring trust","Stop all functions","Ignore","Raise temperature"],e:"Preserve developer trust."},
