  "D5|セッションをまたぐ状態保持の手段は。":{q:"Means to retain state across sessions?",o:["Memory tool","Lower temperature","Add tools","Erase history"],e:"Store info beyond the window and re-reference."},
  "D5|一時的失敗への最適対策は。":{q:"Best measure for transient failures?",o:["Retry with exponential backoff (capped)","Unlimited immediate retries","Give up","Max temperature"],e:"Prevent infinite retries on permanent failures."},
  "D5|連続障害時の全体遅延を防ぐパターンは。":{q:"Pattern to prevent overall delay during consecutive failures?",o:["Circuit breaker","Retry only","Add tools","Increase history"],e:"Cut off calls on consecutive failures."},
  "D5|アクセス失敗と空結果の区別は。":{q:"Distinction between access failure and empty result?",o:["Failure needs retry judgment; empty is accepted","Both success","Both failure","No distinction"],e:"Disguising empty as success is an anti-pattern."},
