  "D1|短期メモリと長期メモリの正しい区別はどれか。":{q:"Correct distinction between short- and long-term memory?",o:["Short-term is volatile in the window; long-term is persistent outside it","Short-term persistent, long-term volatile","Both volatile","Both persistent"],e:"Short-term vanishes at session end; long-term is stored in files or DB."},
